# Space Invaders (Game Off 2025)

## 📌 Overview
This project is a personal reinterpretation of the classic **Space Invaders**, developed in Python using **Pygame**.
It is part of the Game Off 2025 jam and serves both as a creative challenge and a technical exercise.

## 🎮 Gameplay
- Control a spaceship at the bottom of the screen.
- Shoot projectiles to destroy incoming waves of aliens.
- Aliens move horizontally and descend step by step.
- The game ends if aliens reach the ground or the player is hit.
- Score is tracked and displayed in real time.

## ⚙️ Features
- Player movement (left/right).
- Shooting mechanics.
- Enemy waves
- Collision detection (bullets vs aliens).
- Score system.

- Current code size: ~770 lines.
- Hosted under **R2D2G Studios**.

## 📂 Author
Developed by **Ethan (R2D2G Studios)**.

##  How to Run
1. Install Python 3.x and Pygame (`pip install pygame`).
2. Clone the repository.
3. Run `python3 main.py` to start the game.
